      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>3. In-Progress</strong></td>
        <td>Provider &amp; Customer</td>
        <td>Real-time messaging via Socket.io coordinates arrival time and components.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>4. Completed</strong></td>
        <td>Service Provider</td>
